WEBVTT

00:03.420 --> 00:05.600
Let's go over the rules.

00:06.240 --> 00:11.100
If you're able to hit me in the face even 
once, we'll count it as your victory.

00:11.660 --> 00:13.320
And you're sure about this?

00:15.710 --> 00:17.260
Momijiyama-san...

00:19.870 --> 00:24.710
Shy, once this coin hits 
the floor, the fight begins.

00:25.350 --> 00:26.280
Got it?

00:26.280 --> 00:26.880
Yes.

00:30.870 --> 00:34.050
Momijiyama-san!
Don't push yourself too hard!

00:39.620 --> 00:40.640
Here I go!

02:11.150 --> 02:16.490
<b><u>Episode 4
</u>A Heartless Person</b>

02:18.530 --> 02:21.200
Huh? Wh-What just happened?

02:22.350 --> 02:25.100
What's the matter? No need to hold back.

02:30.160 --> 02:33.090
You clearly don't know how to punch someone.

02:33.420 --> 02:36.040
<i>H-He's evading my attacks...</i>

02:36.040 --> 02:37.090
<i>Or rather...</i>

02:38.130 --> 02:38.770
Why, you—

02:38.770 --> 02:40.010
<i>I can't reach him!</i>

02:43.210 --> 02:44.970
You see, this...

02:47.310 --> 02:49.100
is how you punch someone.

02:54.910 --> 02:58.160
People often say I'm a heartless person.

02:59.040 --> 03:01.910
In other words, I lack empathy.

03:02.340 --> 03:05.450
I have absolutely no problem trampling 
on someone else's feelings.

03:06.270 --> 03:11.920
Because I can't empathize with other people's
pain, I have no reservations doing so.

03:12.390 --> 03:16.290
I get it. You have a lot of empathy.

03:16.820 --> 03:21.930
You care about others, pity them,
and do things for their sake.

03:21.930 --> 03:23.510
That's a wonderful thing.

03:24.140 --> 03:27.260
But that's why you're weak, 
and why you can't defeat anyone.

03:28.170 --> 03:33.150
Because your heart is rejecting 
it—rejecting victory.

03:37.000 --> 03:42.840
Wh-Why aren't her attacks hitting 
him? Stardust isn't even moving.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.320
The Heart-shift bracelets...

03:44.800 --> 03:48.960
don't just possess the power to Heart-shift,
but will answer the wearer's heart

03:48.960 --> 03:51.320
and grant them special powers.

03:52.430 --> 03:56.480
Stardust's heart cannot be swayed by anyone.

03:56.480 --> 04:00.630
And his unwavering heart 
controls the flow around him.

04:00.990 --> 04:04.590
The air, power, and heat around him...

04:04.590 --> 04:07.680
They are all under his control.

04:08.280 --> 04:10.020
Yes. That's...

04:10.020 --> 04:11.560
my power.

04:15.520 --> 04:19.230
You'd better bust your ass to 
find your power, or else...

04:19.570 --> 04:21.650
you won't survive.

04:24.720 --> 04:30.410
Get angry. Loathe me. 
Think about wanting to kill me.

04:30.770 --> 04:33.190
Wish for me to die.

04:34.260 --> 04:35.170
Or else...

04:37.500 --> 04:40.460
I will kill you.

04:41.930 --> 04:42.910
Teru-chan!

04:42.600 --> 04:43.500
Stay back!

04:44.700 --> 04:46.780
If you enter, she loses.

04:47.980 --> 04:50.340
You're going way too far with this!

04:50.340 --> 04:52.680
Too far? How so?

04:53.400 --> 04:55.690
You're such a...

04:56.910 --> 04:59.020
I'm used to being glared at.

04:59.020 --> 05:01.620
It does nothing to me.

05:04.120 --> 05:06.450
Well? Are you done now?

05:07.220 --> 05:10.450
You're weak, and you've 
got Spirit all worked up.

05:11.900 --> 05:14.840
No... I'm not...

05:15.650 --> 05:16.900
That so?

05:23.150 --> 05:26.590
Unilord! Please stop him! This is pointless!

05:27.920 --> 05:29.070
I cannot.

05:29.070 --> 05:29.850
Why?!

05:31.460 --> 05:32.590
Her...

05:33.540 --> 05:35.770
Shy's Heart-shift has not come undone.

05:37.310 --> 05:38.770
Which means...

05:39.450 --> 05:41.020
she hasn't given up yet.

05:42.880 --> 05:45.610
Momijiyama-san!
That's enough! Let's go home!

05:46.090 --> 05:49.490
You don't have to go through 
all this just to be a hero!

05:49.740 --> 05:53.490
I know just how hard you worked!

05:54.540 --> 05:57.870
K-Koishikawa-san...

06:01.320 --> 06:03.060
What do you think you're doing?

06:04.350 --> 06:10.640
I-I didn't understand at first...

06:11.120 --> 06:14.390
I-I'll try to win! I'll do my best!

06:14.740 --> 06:21.400
I-I'm so weak, a scaredy-cat, 
a crybaby, a complete failure...

06:21.860 --> 06:25.330
So I have no idea why I said I'd win...

06:25.330 --> 06:27.900
Why does something feel off?

06:28.690 --> 06:34.410
I just remembered... 
Whenever I started whining...

06:35.090 --> 06:37.160
I'd hear a voice.

06:38.480 --> 06:41.090
A voice that calls my name...

06:39.150 --> 06:40.500
Momijiyama-san!

06:41.520 --> 06:45.900
That's what lit the flames 
of courage within me.

06:42.670 --> 06:44.310
Momijiyama-san!

06:49.290 --> 06:50.300
Flames...

06:52.210 --> 06:53.400
Thank goodness.

06:54.240 --> 06:57.850
If I can still stand, I can still do this.

06:58.590 --> 07:00.480
It's gradually awakening...

07:03.560 --> 07:05.990
The power of Shy's Heart-shift bracelets.

07:07.500 --> 07:08.820
Flames, eh?

07:09.280 --> 07:12.430
I guess I just got a glimpse of your powers.

07:13.230 --> 07:16.740
But on its own, that means nothing.

07:17.720 --> 07:18.570
Right.

07:18.980 --> 07:21.620
<i>He's right... I need to 
be able to use my powers.</i>

07:25.150 --> 07:25.880
She's fast!

07:26.170 --> 07:29.680
<i>How hot the flames are 
reflects her life force itself.</i>

07:30.560 --> 07:31.880
<i>It's quite simple, but...</i>

07:34.570 --> 07:37.810
<i>She's able to draw out her strength 
in a straightforward way.</i>

07:40.400 --> 07:42.540
So that's your power?

07:42.900 --> 07:44.190
It doesn't suit you.

07:45.040 --> 07:47.070
You're too weak for it.

07:47.400 --> 07:50.650
I-I mean, yes, I seem weak, but...

07:50.650 --> 07:52.860
I-I definitely just saw it!

07:53.650 --> 07:56.370
You dodged my flames just now.

07:57.520 --> 07:59.540
Which means...

07:59.540 --> 08:02.500
My flames can hit you!

08:04.340 --> 08:05.380
Huh?

08:06.350 --> 08:07.840
Are you stupid?

08:08.430 --> 08:11.340
It's that naïveté that will ensure you lose.

08:11.340 --> 08:15.260
The naïveté of not being 
able to kill your opponent.

08:19.440 --> 08:20.920
And sooner or later,

08:20.920 --> 08:26.150
you will be killed by someone 
who's heartless, like me.

08:28.840 --> 08:30.170
I guess we're done.

08:30.830 --> 08:35.100
You're probably lucky that you 
get to quit being a hero here.

08:37.150 --> 08:38.590
You're a liar...

08:40.250 --> 08:41.710
Truly.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.410
Momijiyama-san...

08:44.660 --> 08:47.250
Saying you don't have a heart...

08:48.600 --> 08:53.580
You knew how weak my 
heart was from the start.

08:54.060 --> 08:57.240
That's why you didn't hold back.

08:57.940 --> 09:01.430
So that I could attack you 
with everything I had.

09:01.770 --> 09:04.310
So that I could hate you.

09:05.400 --> 09:12.440
If that kindness isn't an indication 
of your heart... then what is?

09:13.600 --> 09:17.950
<i>I see... I get it now. 
Why something felt off...</i>

09:18.510 --> 09:21.200
And that's why I need to respond...

09:22.200 --> 09:24.290
to your kindness.

09:24.560 --> 09:26.270
<i>This girl's eyes...</i>

09:27.280 --> 09:30.290
<i>don't have the slightest 
gleam of hatred in them.</i>

09:31.010 --> 09:36.030
<i>Normally, when something 
precious to you is hurt,</i>

09:36.030 --> 09:39.800
<i>you can at least see a glimmer 
of hatred in someone's eyes.</i>

09:40.400 --> 09:43.270
<i>Not that that's ever bugged me.</i>

09:44.140 --> 09:46.560
<i>And yet, this girl...</i>

09:47.040 --> 09:47.810
Here I come!

09:48.140 --> 09:52.230
<i>She said that I'm kind?
What kind of rubbish—</i>

09:53.520 --> 09:55.860
<i>Am I actually mad about this?</i>

09:59.060 --> 10:00.330
You're heartless.

09:59.950 --> 10:00.740
How cruel.

10:01.980 --> 10:02.980
You devil spawn.

10:02.980 --> 10:03.640
Hypocrite.

10:03.640 --> 10:04.820
You piece of shit!

10:06.180 --> 10:07.380
He's wavering.

10:08.080 --> 10:11.080
Stardust's heart, which has never 
been moved by anyone, is wavering.

10:11.590 --> 10:15.760
<i>So what if I am?! 
Call me whatever you want!</i>

10:17.950 --> 10:19.010
Davie.

10:19.870 --> 10:22.390
What happened to your face, Davie?

10:24.120 --> 10:26.550
I got jumped by a bunch 
of jerks again, that's all.

10:27.180 --> 10:30.940
They wouldn't shut up about me 
not having a heart or whatever.

10:30.940 --> 10:32.360
Again?

10:32.840 --> 10:38.140
I didn't really feel anything when I hit 
them, so I guess they were right.

10:39.040 --> 10:41.040
So you actually hit back?

10:41.480 --> 10:44.550
Yeah, and that's when they got me.

10:44.550 --> 10:46.130
Why'd you hit them back?

10:47.370 --> 10:49.150
Why? I mean...

10:49.150 --> 10:52.380
It irritated you, didn't it? 
Getting told you don't have a heart.

10:53.400 --> 10:56.260
If you felt irritated, that just 
means you <i>do</i> have a heart!

10:57.240 --> 10:59.330
That seems like a far-fetched argument.

11:00.010 --> 11:02.780
If you got annoyed by them 
saying you don't have a heart,

11:02.780 --> 11:07.340
that just means you want to 
become a person with a heart.

11:10.220 --> 11:14.720
I don't even understand 
what it means to have a heart.

11:14.720 --> 11:18.530
Well, I'm pretty sure no one 
else in the world does, either.

11:22.040 --> 11:27.400
I know, Davie. You should strive to 
be the nicest person in the world!

11:28.330 --> 11:31.160
That'll throw those bozos and 
the rest of the world for a loop!

11:31.160 --> 11:34.920
You'd prove how worthless all the 
labels people throw around are.

11:34.920 --> 11:40.050
Then everyone would get it! 
That sounds great.

11:41.070 --> 11:43.920
You're a bit messed up in the head, too.

11:43.920 --> 11:47.360
I am not! I just like entertaining things.

11:53.400 --> 11:56.690
<i>Why did I recall something 
from so long ago right now?</i>

12:00.050 --> 12:03.450
<i>My body feels heavy... 
I'm losing consciousness.</i>

12:03.880 --> 12:05.360
<i>But so what?!</i>

12:05.740 --> 12:08.890
<i>I have to make sure my 
heart gets through to him!</i>

12:09.450 --> 12:10.370
<i>Because...</i>

12:11.050 --> 12:13.710
<i>The nicest person in the world!</i>

12:14.220 --> 12:15.540
<i>Even I'm...</i>

12:16.160 --> 12:17.750
<i>a hero!</i>

12:25.770 --> 12:26.670
Teru-chan!

12:26.670 --> 12:27.990
Momijiyama-san!

12:30.500 --> 12:33.120
You let this happen to yourself just to...

12:34.130 --> 12:35.390
Spirit.

12:36.280 --> 12:39.120
She isn't cut out to be a hero after all.

12:39.120 --> 12:41.030
She's too pure and naïve.

12:41.660 --> 12:45.520
She can't fight at her fullest even when 
she's faced with a loathsome enemy.

12:45.520 --> 12:47.780
She's always controlled by her emotions.

12:48.410 --> 12:50.540
That's why her power is so unstable.

12:50.890 --> 12:56.290
In the end, she overused a power she's 
not accustomed to and burned out.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.790
She's clearly too reckless.

13:00.870 --> 13:03.300
But maybe...

13:03.850 --> 13:09.550
the ones who'll change this world 
in the future will be fools like her.

13:09.830 --> 13:11.480
Stardust?

13:11.480 --> 13:13.060
I lost.

13:13.690 --> 13:18.810
That last blow managed to hit my cheek 
before her Heart-shift came undone.

13:20.110 --> 13:22.570
Tell her congratulations.

13:23.230 --> 13:25.570
I've already contacted a doctor.

13:25.950 --> 13:27.660
Have them check her as soon as possible.

13:36.100 --> 13:39.210
A kind person, huh?

13:42.580 --> 13:43.580
Shy.

13:45.550 --> 13:49.010
<u>Stardust
Real Name: Davie W. John 
Nationality: England
Likes: Meat pies, music
A charismatic hero-slash-rockstar</u>

13:56.060 --> 13:59.010
Well, thanks, Stardust.

14:00.500 --> 14:03.280
Your expression doesn't match your words.

14:03.530 --> 14:06.890
Oh, shut up. Don't make me knock you out.

14:06.890 --> 14:08.660
Are you sure you should be here?

14:09.100 --> 14:11.670
Iko-chan's here. I'd just get in their way.

14:13.630 --> 14:18.980
Regardless of how it was done, 
Teru-chan is now prepared to fight.

14:18.980 --> 14:21.170
And that's thanks to you.

14:21.700 --> 14:24.100
So... thanks.

14:24.100 --> 14:25.630
You're  welcome, I guess.

14:25.630 --> 14:26.170
But!

14:26.780 --> 14:29.460
I still hate your damn guts!

14:30.430 --> 14:35.160
Ugh, you're so unbelievable! 
Who goes that far against a girl?!

14:36.940 --> 14:41.690
Honestly, I'm quite fond of the way 
you wear your heart on your sleeve.

14:41.690 --> 14:45.080
What?! That's it! I'm kicking your ass!

14:45.080 --> 14:47.330
Well, I'm heading home.

14:47.950 --> 14:50.760
You're running away! Hold it right there!

14:57.720 --> 15:00.460
Huh? Where am I?

15:00.460 --> 15:03.040
You're in the infirmary on the spacecraft.

15:03.430 --> 15:05.920
So you're finally awake now?

15:06.320 --> 15:09.360
You slept for two hours
 after you were treated.

15:09.360 --> 15:13.900
How dumb. You know, your friend 
wore herself out crying and fell asleep.

15:15.530 --> 15:18.810
Wh-Who are you?

15:19.090 --> 15:24.080
What?! You're a newbie and you don't 
know who I am?! Are you stupid?!

15:24.080 --> 15:25.070
Stupid?!

15:25.310 --> 15:28.490
Wait, um... I need my glasses...

15:28.490 --> 15:31.450
Wait! I know! I just need 
to do the thing, right?!

15:33.620 --> 15:38.080
Even in the deepest darkness where the light 
doesn't reach, Black will be by your side.

15:38.920 --> 15:43.540
The light that shines upon the hearts of this 
world is a black star that shines on this Earth.

15:43.880 --> 15:48.700
I'm the Black Cross Nurse: Lady Black!

15:48.050 --> 15:49.840
<b>Lady Black</b>

15:48.050 --> 15:49.840
<b>Switzerland's Hero</b>

15:50.690 --> 15:53.840
I'll never give up on life.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.680
Wow...

15:57.680 --> 16:00.850
Don't "Wow..." me! Are you stupid?! 
Do you not know who I am?!

16:01.520 --> 16:06.110
Now, now. Be quiet in the 
patient's room. Get along, now.

16:06.110 --> 16:09.520
Don't be stupid, Doctor! I can't 
get along with this stupid girl!

16:09.520 --> 16:11.610
<i>She just keeps calling me stupid...</i>

16:12.090 --> 16:17.350
Sorry about that. Lady has quite the bark, 
but she's actually a very good girl deep down.

16:14.360 --> 16:18.990
<b>Doctor Schwartz</b>

16:14.360 --> 16:18.990
<b>Germany's Hero</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:18.990
I do not bark!

16:19.490 --> 16:21.160
Don't mind her.

16:21.160 --> 16:22.870
Oh... Thank you.

16:23.100 --> 16:27.290
U-Um, I beg your pardon, but... 
who are you two?

16:27.640 --> 16:30.830
We're Black Cross heroes.

16:30.830 --> 16:32.300
Black Cross?

16:32.570 --> 16:36.330
It's an international rescue 
organization created by Stardust.

16:36.330 --> 16:41.000
I'm their representative and 
chief medical officer, Doctor Schwartz.

16:41.680 --> 16:44.930
And I came here as one of the nurses.

16:44.930 --> 16:47.690
By the way, I'm also
the one who treated you.

16:48.470 --> 16:52.440
You haven't realized that you don't have 
a single scratch on your body, have you?

16:52.440 --> 16:55.200
Huh? Wait! You're right!

16:55.500 --> 17:00.830
My power is "Healing." Basically, I have 
the heart that can heal the masses.

17:00.830 --> 17:02.130
Healing...

17:02.130 --> 17:05.670
I guess Stardust acknowledged 
you because of your flames,

17:05.670 --> 17:10.000
but when you're doing your job as a hero, 
your power should come naturally to you.

17:10.000 --> 17:12.490
Frankly speaking, you lack talent.

17:16.540 --> 17:17.940
Did you hear me?

17:18.920 --> 17:22.100
I said he acknowledged you!

17:22.100 --> 17:23.850
Huh? Acknowledged?

17:24.240 --> 17:26.890
Stardust left a message for you.

17:26.890 --> 17:28.350
He said, "Congratulations."

17:28.640 --> 17:32.120
That means... I can stay a hero.

17:34.340 --> 17:38.140
But... I wasn't able to do anything.

17:38.530 --> 17:41.120
Is this... really okay?

17:42.400 --> 17:47.360
Just so you know, I don't acknowledge 
you as Japan's hero at all!

17:48.240 --> 17:50.160
You turned into a shut-in over an accident.

17:49.670 --> 17:50.670
<i><b>Stab</b></i>

17:50.670 --> 17:54.450
You can't use your heart's power well, 
and you're quick to complain!

17:52.420 --> 17:53.420
<i><b>Stab</b></i>

17:53.670 --> 17:54.670
<i><b>Stab</b></i>

17:54.920 --> 18:00.680
Listen up! Heroes are able to 
reassure people just by being there!

18:00.970 --> 18:03.060
So what did you do?

18:03.060 --> 18:05.580
You made a civilian feel nervous and cry.

18:05.580 --> 18:08.190
Then you get knocked out and 
take her down with you?!

18:08.190 --> 18:10.510
Can you really call yourself a hero?

18:10.510 --> 18:11.940
Way to go.

18:12.800 --> 18:17.070
I don't know if you're Shy or whatever, but 
I'm going to give you a piece of my mind.

18:17.860 --> 18:22.700
If you're ashamed of yourself, 
quit being a hero right this instant!

18:24.240 --> 18:25.920
Enough of this, Doctor.

18:25.920 --> 18:27.820
We've done our work. Let's go home.

18:27.820 --> 18:29.710
Yes, you're right. Let's go.

18:31.180 --> 18:36.460
Lady can be a bit harsh, but 
that's how she expresses herself.

18:36.780 --> 18:39.970
She's basically saying to become 
someone you can be proud of.

18:40.440 --> 18:43.970
See you again, young lady. 
Give our regards to your friend.

18:48.520 --> 18:50.060
A hero...

18:54.080 --> 18:55.720
Momijiyama-san...

18:56.420 --> 18:57.470
You're awake.

18:58.590 --> 19:03.070
I'm sorry for dragging you 
into this, Koishikawa-san.

19:04.550 --> 19:06.830
You worked so hard, Momijiyama-san!

19:07.260 --> 19:08.920
U-Um...

19:22.520 --> 19:26.330
Well, I have to go this way. 
I'll see you later, Momijiyama-san.

19:29.670 --> 19:31.460
Wait, Koishikawa-san!

19:32.520 --> 19:34.610
Um, I...

19:34.990 --> 19:38.610
I'm sorry. I made you worry a lot.

19:38.930 --> 19:43.280
When I thought about how my 
weakness made everyone anxious,

19:43.280 --> 19:44.870
I just felt so pathetic.

19:45.680 --> 19:49.390
I'm still not really heroic at all...

19:49.390 --> 19:50.120
But...

19:51.050 --> 19:54.040
I'm going to become
strong, no matter what!

19:54.040 --> 19:56.970
So that you'll never have to cry again!

19:57.400 --> 19:59.380
So... huh?

19:59.720 --> 20:01.880
Sorry... Why am I...

20:02.230 --> 20:05.350
I just said I was gonna be stronger... so why...

20:05.350 --> 20:08.390
Are you okay? Here, use this.

20:09.610 --> 20:12.220
I'm so sorry... I'm so sorry.

20:13.890 --> 20:17.730
You know, Momijiyama-san, 
you can be pretty passionate.

20:18.180 --> 20:22.900
Maybe that's why your heart's 
power is hot flames.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.630
But... I'm just...

20:25.630 --> 20:28.120
Oh, I just thought of something.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.910
You know, because you're so shy...

20:32.500 --> 20:34.790
Your face is so red, it might 
just burst into flames.

20:36.230 --> 20:36.880
Huh?

20:41.070 --> 20:42.830
Wouldn't that be funny?

20:42.830 --> 20:45.300
Is that where this is going?

20:55.460 --> 20:57.730
Teru, look at this news.

20:57.730 --> 20:59.730
<b>Public Disturbance in China
Several Injured</b>

20:57.980 --> 21:02.320
<i>Next, we have news about the 
riots that occurred in China.</i>

21:02.680 --> 21:04.710
<i>At around 6:00 PM JST,</i>

21:04.710 --> 21:10.330
<i>a lone man caused a public disturbance
in China. Several were injured.</i>

21:06.570 --> 21:12.750
<b>Public Disturbance in China
Several Injured</b>

21:06.570 --> 21:12.750
Footage: Viewer

21:11.680 --> 21:12.750
Shrimpy-san...

21:13.100 --> 21:14.260
Isn't that...

21:14.260 --> 21:18.130
Looks like Stigma's been 
a lot more active lately.

21:18.130 --> 21:21.630
<i>The hero Mianlong arrived at the scene 
and was able to pacify the situation.</i>

21:18.750 --> 21:21.050
This could mean something 
else might happen soon.

21:22.280 --> 21:24.830
We need to be extra careful, as well.

21:24.830 --> 21:25.580
Yeah.

21:27.060 --> 21:29.510
<i>I can't forget the pain from today.</i>

21:29.740 --> 21:32.290
<i>Honestly, I'm surrounded by scary things,</i>

21:32.290 --> 21:35.020
<i>But from now on, I can't falter.</i>

21:35.490 --> 21:38.220
<i>So that I can be everyone's hero!</i>

21:39.240 --> 21:40.300
Shrimpy-san!

21:40.300 --> 21:41.110
Oh?

21:41.360 --> 21:42.840
I'd like seconds, please!

21:42.840 --> 21:44.550
That's the spirit, Teru!

23:21.710 --> 23:24.840
<b>Momijiyama-san.</b>

23:22.670 --> 23:24.840
<b>Is it true you're naked 
when you Heart-shift?</b>

23:23.580 --> 23:24.840
<b>Koishikawa-san?!</b>

23:25.250 --> 23:26.590
<b>So...</b>

23:26.630 --> 23:28.340
<b>I've got
a high-speed
camera ready!</b>

23:27.550 --> 23:28.340
<b>Where'd you get that?!</b>

23:28.710 --> 23:30.680
<b>Momijiyama-san,
try Heart-shifting!</b>

23:29.760 --> 23:30.680
Er...

23:31.840 --> 23:33.390
<i>Blush</i>

23:33.640 --> 23:37.060
<b>Eek! No,
I can't!</b>

23:34.550 --> 23:37.060
Aw...

23:35.470 --> 23:37.060
<b>She couldn't
Heart-shift again
for a while.</b>
